alues before importing; I preserved what was in the file rather than inventing substitutes, but:\n\n- `source` is `monitor.example.invalid` — a reserved non-resolvable domain\n- `revision` `0123456789abcdef...` doesn't exist in this repo (HEAD is `ae2b7dd`)\n\nIf this was meant to carry a real incident, correct `incident.json` and re-run validate/import/init before authoring a recipe — otherwise the corrective work binds to a revision that doesn't exist. If it's intentionally a fixture, the intake as it stands is correct and consistent.","ttft_ms":1754,"type":"result","duration_ms":88145,"uuid":"8bec3b28-f73e-46d5-928f-4b7325a6a65c","ttft_stream_ms":1321,"time_to_request_ms":398,"first_content_frame_ms":1321,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
